WEBVTT

1
00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:41.958
MY BELOVED DEMON

2
00:00:47.422 --> 00:00:48.339
A hidden camera?

3
00:01:02.312 --> 00:01:03.229
Haida

4
00:01:14.157 --> 00:01:15.325
What the…

5
00:01:57.784 --> 00:01:58.910
Well…

6
00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:04.916
I was just covering our faces
so that he does not recognize us.

7
00:02:07.877 --> 00:02:09.254
Rightly so.

8
00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:13.424
Why did your powers suddenly stop working?

9
00:02:14.008 --> 00:02:16.010
And really? Why didn't they work?

10
00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:21.724
But To Kyung.

11
00:02:32.694 --> 00:02:33.653
He left.

12
00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:38.741
Where did he go?

13
00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:40.034
Did he go outside?

14
00:02:42.162 --> 00:02:43.580
STORAGE CAMERA

15
00:03:12.108 --> 00:03:13.985
We won't let No To Kyung see this.

16
00:03:19.198 --> 00:03:21.701
{\an8}What was he looking for here?

17
00:03:21.784 --> 00:03:23.036
{\an8}Has he already taken it?

18
00:03:24.078 --> 00:03:25.121
{\an8}What are you looking for?

19
00:03:28.791 --> 00:03:30.501
{\an8}You are the woman who talked about Arabic.

20
00:03:30.585 --> 00:03:32.086
{\an8}Arabic?

21
00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:33.004
{\an8}Coffee?

22
00:03:33.087 --> 00:03:34.255
{\an8}What are you looking for?

23
00:03:34.339 --> 00:03:36.424
{\an8}I know this place very well, so tell me.

24
00:03:37.008 --> 00:03:37.842
{\an8}Who are you?

25
00:03:38.426 --> 00:03:39.344
{\an8}And who do I look like?

26
00:03:39.427 --> 00:03:41.054
{\an8}- To beggar.
- Bingo.

27
00:03:41.554 --> 00:03:43.181
{\an8}I accept money orders.

28
00:03:43.264 --> 00:03:44.807
{\an8}JESUS CORPORATION
BANK "TEKUK"

29
00:03:44.891 --> 00:03:46.059
{\an8}"The Jesus Corporation"?

30
00:03:46.142 --> 00:03:48.436
{\an8}Sounds pretty reliable, right?

31
00:03:49.479 --> 00:03:51.189
{\an8}Where did you sneak in?

32
00:03:51.272 --> 00:03:54.234
I didn't sneak up on you.
You just didn't notice me.

33
00:03:54.317 --> 00:03:55.777
And it wasn't me who climbed in here.

34
00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:57.904
You came to my territory.

35
00:03:58.947 --> 00:03:59.781
Your area?

36
00:04:05.662 --> 00:04:07.622
I have the best seat here.

37
00:04:07.705 --> 00:04:09.207
Warm and sunny.

38
00:04:10.959 --> 00:04:12.585
We don't have time for that.

39
00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:18.174
Blinking

40
00:04:22.553 --> 00:04:24.555
That which flashes

41
00:04:24.639 --> 00:04:26.266
will fade sooner rather than later.

42
00:04:31.104 --> 00:04:32.313
Do you know her?

43
00:04:33.481 --> 00:04:36.359
She is just another crazy person
with a corrupted soul.

44
00:04:37.235 --> 00:04:38.528
Ignore her.

45
00:04:49.664 --> 00:04:56.379
EPISODE 7
TENSE RELATIONSHIPS

46
00:05:00.383 --> 00:05:01.509
Where did he go?

47
00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:03.594
Let's pursue him.

48
00:05:03.678 --> 00:05:04.971
This should be enough.

49
00:05:06.723 --> 00:05:07.640
where are you going

50
00:05:08.182 --> 00:05:09.183
I want to try something.

51
00:05:17.859 --> 00:05:19.027
Everything is fine with my powers.

52
00:05:20.153 --> 00:05:21.779
So what went wrong before?

53
00:05:21.863 --> 00:05:23.573
First, let's find No To Kyung.

54
00:05:41.632 --> 00:05:43.009
Shall we follow him inside?

55
00:05:43.092 --> 00:05:44.469
No, it's too…

56
00:05:58.649 --> 00:06:00.359
It's too risky.

57
00:06:02.236 --> 00:06:03.237
That's enough for today.

58
00:06:23.424 --> 00:06:24.467
That's Köne.

59
00:06:28.221 --> 00:06:30.223
- What?
- Can we talk a little?

60
00:06:32.433 --> 00:06:34.894
Are you seeing your psychiatrist now?

61
00:06:36.479 --> 00:06:38.940
I want to take a break from treatment.
I am very busy right now.

62
00:06:41.067 --> 00:06:42.360
oh one more thing

63
00:06:42.985 --> 00:06:46.823
your father asked
what have you been doing lately

64
00:06:46.906 --> 00:06:47.824
AND?

65
00:06:48.783 --> 00:06:50.118
I told him that I don't know.

66
00:06:51.786 --> 00:06:52.870
As expected.

67
00:06:53.788 --> 00:06:55.456
So don't know anything.

68
00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:56.374
That's Köne.

69
00:06:56.457 --> 00:06:57.875
I can take care of myself.

70
00:06:57.959 --> 00:06:59.544
That's why it's time to make appointments for me.

71
00:06:59.627 --> 00:07:01.921
Psychiatrists cannot be trusted.

72
00:07:20.148 --> 00:07:21.232
Mrs.

73
00:07:22.525 --> 00:07:25.069
We had a great meditation today.

74
00:07:25.736 --> 00:07:28.239
I have to attend a charity event tomorrow.

75
00:07:28.322 --> 00:07:30.616
so can we change the meeting time?

76
00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:31.534
Of course.

77
00:07:31.617 --> 00:07:32.869
Thank you.

78
00:07:34.871 --> 00:07:36.414
Bad connection?

79
00:07:36.497 --> 00:07:37.874
What was the problem?

80
00:07:47.925 --> 00:07:49.385
This makes the head spin.

81
00:07:51.929 --> 00:07:52.763
Here it is.

82
00:07:52.847 --> 00:07:54.557
The same thing happened that day.

83
00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:56.309
The day I lost my strength.

84
00:07:56.392 --> 00:07:59.896
<i>I was almost hit by a car,
because the forces did not obey me.</i>

85
00:07:59.979 --> 00:08:01.939
<i>And this is how my dad moved to you.</i>

86
00:08:04.442 --> 00:08:05.651
The problem is definitely in you.

87
00:08:05.735 --> 00:08:08.154
If someone has a problem,
it's in you don't blame me

88
00:08:08.237 --> 00:08:09.280
I don't blame you.

89
00:08:09.363 --> 00:08:12.700
But my strength is like never before
didn't blink until we met.

90
00:08:12.783 --> 00:08:15.411
And my dad didn't go to anyone.

91
00:08:15.995 --> 00:08:17.246
Can't you hear yourself?

92
00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:18.706
you accuse me of

93
00:08:18.789 --> 00:08:22.543
that you were almost hit by a car
and that the tattoo passed to me.

94
00:08:22.627 --> 00:08:23.753
And you blame me

95
00:08:24.378 --> 00:08:26.756
in the flickering of your <i>amazing </i>powers.

96
00:08:26.839 --> 00:08:30.718
I want to say that it will be bad
if they don't work again when they should.

97
00:08:30.801 --> 00:08:32.803
- As before.
- "Bad"?

98
00:08:33.638 --> 00:08:35.806
If it's so bad, why did you do it?

99
00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:37.350
Do you think I liked it?

100
00:08:37.433 --> 00:08:39.477
- Do you think I liked it?
- Did you like it?

101
00:08:49.403 --> 00:08:52.823
Why is Mr. Pak not here yet?

102
00:08:53.783 --> 00:08:56.827
I can't even
drink your coffee in peace.

103
00:08:57.537 --> 00:08:59.747
where's the coffee

104
00:09:10.132 --> 00:09:11.926
COMPLETION OF CONSTRUCTION
"SUNVOL THEATER"

105
00:09:16.639 --> 00:09:17.932
"Sunwol Theater"...

106
00:09:59.307 --> 00:10:02.018
Are you going to some newlyweds for a housewarming party?

107
00:10:02.101 --> 00:10:04.854
They are not actually married.
and this is not a housewarming party.

108
00:10:04.937 --> 00:10:07.440
I was just kidding. Don't be so harsh.

109
00:10:07.523 --> 00:10:10.067
I'm not strict. But you are too relaxed.

110
00:10:11.485 --> 00:10:14.071
There are many here. It seems that there is no need for this.

111
00:10:14.864 --> 00:10:16.574
Have you ever heard this phrase?

112
00:10:16.657 --> 00:10:20.828
"When a person comes,
then her whole life comes with her."

113
00:10:28.169 --> 00:10:30.546
Here, life!

114
00:10:31.088 --> 00:10:32.590
Here!

115
00:10:36.344 --> 00:10:38.888
Is all this still like that?

116
00:10:38.971 --> 00:10:40.973
My clothes, necessary things

117
00:10:41.057 --> 00:10:43.768
and a small collection dear to me,
which reflects my taste.

118
00:10:45.019 --> 00:10:47.313
- You call it a small collection?
- Yes.

119
00:10:47.396 --> 00:10:49.899
It's like he moved in with me
the entire Sunvol Foundation.

120
00:10:49.982 --> 00:10:53.361
That's because we
and "Sunvol Foundation" are inseparable.

121
00:10:54.153 --> 00:10:55.821
Where should I put it?

122
00:10:55.905 --> 00:10:58.032
These are my treasures. Put it here.

123
00:10:58.115 --> 00:10:59.784
No, there is no room here.

124
00:11:00.493 --> 00:11:02.745
- Put them in To To Hee's room, which is over there.
- Good.

125
00:11:02.828 --> 00:11:03.996
No!

126
00:11:10.378 --> 00:11:13.005
can we talk

127
00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:18.803
And what is that? Can it wait?

128
00:11:30.731 --> 00:11:32.400
You are not the only one who lives here.

129
00:11:33.567 --> 00:11:35.236
We live in an apartment together.

130
00:11:35.319 --> 00:11:36.612
And what?

131
00:11:37.113 --> 00:11:38.364
Get rid of unnecessary things.

132
00:11:38.447 --> 00:11:40.825
Then everything remains. I need everything.

133
00:11:40.908 --> 00:11:42.368
- Get rid of it immediately.
- No.

134
00:11:42.451 --> 00:11:44.537
Do you want to live in such a cluttered apartment?

135
00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:46.497
What are you living for?
in such a tiny apartment?

136
00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:48.040
It's not that the apartment is tiny.

137
00:11:48.124 --> 00:11:51.377
Just yours
too many things, drive.

138
00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:52.878
It's not just some stuff.

139
00:11:52.962 --> 00:11:56.215
They all reflect my taste and history
and reveal who I am.

140
00:11:56.298 --> 00:11:57.716
They are Jung Ku Won.

141
00:12:04.014 --> 00:12:05.558
You leave me no choice.

142
00:12:13.524 --> 00:12:16.026
Enjoy life
with my infinite other selves.

143
00:12:22.491 --> 00:12:24.243
At least give me my coffee.

144
00:12:26.287 --> 00:12:27.329
Thank you.

145
00:12:38.132 --> 00:12:41.552
It finally comes out that you are married.

146
00:12:41.635 --> 00:12:43.137
So what kind of marriage is that?

147
00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:46.056
I can not even calmly bring
to this house your things?

148
00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:48.767
How should I know? I'm sweet solo.

149
00:12:48.851 --> 00:12:50.352
Not that you'd have a chance

150
00:12:50.436 --> 00:12:52.313
but you shouldn't get married.

151
00:12:52.396 --> 00:12:54.356
- Don't worry!
- My coffee!

152
00:12:55.608 --> 00:12:56.525
Think what you say.

153
00:12:58.235 --> 00:12:59.987
I will take things with me.

154
00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:01.238
Go back inside.

155
00:13:01.322 --> 00:13:02.156
No.

156
00:13:02.239 --> 00:13:03.991
I have pride.

157
00:13:04.074 --> 00:13:05.451
I can't come back like this.

158
00:13:09.079 --> 00:13:11.081
You know how hard it was to get it.

159
00:13:12.041 --> 00:13:13.000
do you know

160
00:13:13.083 --> 00:13:14.210
Is everything so bad?

161
00:13:14.293 --> 00:13:15.586
I will not drink it.

162
00:13:15.669 --> 00:13:17.421
Maybe because of the garlic I ate.

163
00:13:20.466 --> 00:13:22.384
Just such a marriage.

164
00:13:25.596 --> 00:13:27.723
You talk as if you are married.

165
00:13:28.307 --> 00:13:29.308
I got married.

166
00:13:30.768 --> 00:13:33.562
- What?
- To be more precise, I was married.

167
00:13:34.522 --> 00:13:35.523
When did it happen?

168
00:13:35.606 --> 00:13:37.358
On a long vacation five years ago.

169
00:13:37.441 --> 00:13:40.986
Just in case, I didn't tell anyone.

170
00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.404
She did everything quietly.

171
00:13:43.155 --> 00:13:44.657
This is the only

172
00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:47.159
that I did well in that marriage.

173
00:13:53.749 --> 00:13:57.211
Marriage is crazy in many ways.

174
00:14:00.798 --> 00:14:01.799
Is this too?

175
00:14:02.466 --> 00:14:03.634
I'm lucky.

176
00:14:07.805 --> 00:14:09.557
Do you see? Everything went in.

177
00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:12.184
How can she live in an apartment
smaller than a car?

178
00:14:12.268 --> 00:14:14.770
The apartment is not too small.
And your greed is too great.

179
00:14:14.853 --> 00:14:17.189
Look at all these things of yours.

180
00:14:20.067 --> 00:14:22.486
She's so crazy

181
00:14:23.904 --> 00:14:24.905
Who is this?

182
00:14:24.989 --> 00:14:25.990
"Who is this?"

183
00:14:27.157 --> 00:14:29.285
Mr. Who, won't you come back?

184
00:14:30.703 --> 00:14:32.621
You told me to live with my other selves.

185
00:14:37.668 --> 00:14:40.629
Did he just run away from home?

186
00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:46.176
Did he run away after one day?

187
00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:47.970
I have to teach him.

188
00:14:48.053 --> 00:14:49.513
I will never call him.

189
00:14:50.472 --> 00:14:51.307
It was not necessary...

190
00:14:52.975 --> 00:14:54.810
When did he hide it here?

191
00:14:55.352 --> 00:14:57.521
Unbelievable. You kicked me out.

192
00:14:58.522 --> 00:14:59.940
It's time for you to go.

193
00:15:00.024 --> 00:15:01.317
Go work on your performance.

194
00:15:02.943 --> 00:15:06.280
The point is that Star Chin is gone,
when I found out about your wedding.

195
00:15:06.864 --> 00:15:08.866
Press conference tomorrow
and she is not in touch.

196
00:15:08.949 --> 00:15:10.326
And she misses rehearsals.

197
00:15:10.409 --> 00:15:13.287
Can you go talk to her?

198
00:15:13.787 --> 00:15:14.622
Why should I?

199
00:15:14.705 --> 00:15:17.124
She probably thinks
that her guardian is betraying her.

200
00:15:17.207 --> 00:15:19.084
leave it Cancel the show if it doesn't come back.

201
00:15:19.168 --> 00:15:20.794
- I can't just...
- Go.

202
00:15:21.378 --> 00:15:22.755
- Anyway...
- Just go!

203
00:15:37.811 --> 00:15:39.021
What is it anyway?

204
00:15:42.274 --> 00:15:44.276
He has too many of these selves.

205
00:15:45.235 --> 00:15:47.321
The ego has already multiplied.

206
00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:52.159
You bought yourself a rag.

207
00:16:00.084 --> 00:16:01.043
A rag?

208
00:16:02.294 --> 00:16:04.630
The one who is always there.

209
00:16:04.713 --> 00:16:08.092
You take this person for granted
so you neglect her

210
00:16:08.175 --> 00:16:11.428
you blame everything
because you are so easy with her.

211
00:16:12.554 --> 00:16:14.098
It was like that between us.

212
00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:19.019
Is that why you threw me a surprise party?

213
00:16:19.103 --> 00:16:20.312
What did I appreciate you?

214
00:16:21.981 --> 00:16:24.733
you really wanted
for me to love you, right?

215
00:16:24.817 --> 00:16:27.861
i like
that we treated each other that way.

216
00:16:29.363 --> 00:16:31.281
This is how a real family should be.

217
00:16:32.741 --> 00:16:34.994
Although we are not relatives,

218
00:16:36.328 --> 00:16:38.122
we were family to each other.

219
00:16:41.166 --> 00:16:42.251
I agree.

220
00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:46.296
But don't worry.

221
00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:48.799
No one can ever replace you.

222
00:16:55.389 --> 00:16:56.849
SOK HOON

223
00:17:05.816 --> 00:17:06.859
Hi Seok Hoon.

224
00:17:06.942 --> 00:17:08.610
<i>Hello To Hee. Where are you?

225
00:17:08.694 --> 00:17:11.238
I want to talk to you alone.

226
00:17:11.321 --> 00:17:12.740
About what?

227
00:17:14.575 --> 00:17:16.535
This is about Mr. Jung Ku Won.

228
00:17:22.291 --> 00:17:23.834
So you won't call me?

229
00:17:24.877 --> 00:17:26.712
Then I'll just live in a car.

230
00:17:27.296 --> 00:17:28.297
It's a little thing.

231
00:17:34.428 --> 00:17:35.429
A little

232
00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:39.016
Why so many things?

233
00:17:51.195 --> 00:17:52.738
It's better here than in the apartment.

234
00:17:52.821 --> 00:17:54.656
More spacious and comfortable.

235
00:18:08.796 --> 00:18:10.547
I didn't know you were here, Ms. Sin.

236
00:18:10.631 --> 00:18:12.925
I'm here because Mr. Chong
moved here today.

237
00:18:14.802 --> 00:18:15.844
Of course.

238
00:18:17.346 --> 00:18:19.431
- Shall we talk in the office?
- Of course.

239
00:18:22.643 --> 00:18:24.061
<i>What is the matter?</i>

240
00:18:25.312 --> 00:18:28.440
Has Mr. Jeon officially moved?

241
00:18:28.524 --> 00:18:30.400
We must prevent rumors about our marriage.

242
00:18:32.528 --> 00:18:34.863
What is it? Just say it already.

243
00:18:34.947 --> 00:18:37.407
Is Jung Koo Won in trouble or something?

244
00:18:38.617 --> 00:18:41.787
To Hee, how much do you know about him?

245
00:18:42.454 --> 00:18:44.081
Well…

246
00:18:44.623 --> 00:18:46.959
There is nothing to know about him.

247
00:18:47.042 --> 00:18:50.879
Did you thoroughly investigate him before marriage?

248
00:18:53.048 --> 00:18:55.425
Are you talking about his family or education?

249
00:18:56.760 --> 00:18:58.095
I want to show you something.

250
00:19:06.895 --> 00:19:10.524
This is from the completion ceremony
of the "Sunvol" theater back in 1977.

251
00:19:12.276 --> 00:19:13.110
Look at this.

252
00:19:14.987 --> 00:19:16.697
This is Mr. Chong.

253
00:19:31.044 --> 00:19:33.213
He looks like a grandfather like two drops of water.

254
00:19:34.756 --> 00:19:36.675
This is the past executive director.

255
00:19:38.343 --> 00:19:39.845
Do you really think so?

256
00:19:39.928 --> 00:19:41.138
And what else?

257
00:19:42.139 --> 00:19:44.057
What are the dominant genes.

258
00:19:44.141 --> 00:19:45.517
How are they so similar?

259
00:20:00.908 --> 00:20:02.242
THE MAN CHOSEN BY TO TO HI
BEAUTY AND WEALTH CHEON KU WONA

260
00:20:02.326 --> 00:20:03.785
No signal underground?

261
00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:21.178
That's better.

262
00:20:24.014 --> 00:20:25.265
Works

263
00:20:25.349 --> 00:20:27.476
Works

264
00:20:27.976 --> 00:20:29.269
It works!

265
00:20:32.481 --> 00:20:33.857
Oh, leave it.

266
00:20:37.569 --> 00:20:39.446
I didn't know we were expecting a guest.

267
00:20:39.529 --> 00:20:40.989
I had to talk to To Hee.

268
00:20:41.073 --> 00:20:42.032
What exactly?

269
00:20:43.992 --> 00:20:45.285
Let's go have a drink.

270
00:20:48.997 --> 00:20:51.625
Aren't you curious about what To Hee and I were talking about?

271
00:20:59.925 --> 00:21:01.051
Get down to business.

272
00:21:01.134 --> 00:21:03.428
I don't want to take too long
leave To To Hee alone.

273
00:21:03.512 --> 00:21:04.554
Don't worry.

274
00:21:04.638 --> 00:21:06.223
Ms. Sin is with her.

275
00:21:06.306 --> 00:21:08.684
That's good. I can trust her.

276
00:21:10.018 --> 00:21:12.062
It seems that there are many things

277
00:21:12.145 --> 00:21:14.439
which you and To Hee don't tell me.

278
00:21:15.941 --> 00:21:18.568
That's because we have a very special relationship.

279
00:21:25.492 --> 00:21:26.952
You're not human, are you?

280
00:21:28.537 --> 00:21:29.538
What are you…

281
00:21:31.206 --> 00:21:32.249
What do you mean?

282
00:21:32.332 --> 00:21:34.209
I'm obviously human, right?

283
00:21:36.003 --> 00:21:36.837
are you a vampire

284
00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:38.880
Don't compare me
with those damn mosquitoes.

285
00:21:45.387 --> 00:21:48.932
I find you very suspicious, Mr. Chong.

286
00:21:49.016 --> 00:21:51.935
Isn't it because you just hate me?

287
00:21:52.811 --> 00:21:53.812
This is also true.

288
00:21:54.563 --> 00:21:56.148
When the speech has already come,

289
00:21:56.231 --> 00:21:58.942
I plan to follow you.

290
00:21:59.860 --> 00:22:04.573
If it becomes clear,
that you can hurt To Hee

291
00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:10.829
I will not sit idly by, Mr. Chong.

292
00:22:13.874 --> 00:22:15.125
What then?

293
00:22:15.208 --> 00:22:18.462
I will dig up your secret
and I will tell it to the whole world.

294
00:22:20.172 --> 00:22:21.882
I'm not afraid at all.

295
00:22:21.965 --> 00:22:24.134
You don't know how to threaten at all.

296
00:22:25.969 --> 00:22:28.055
I agree, I'm not a terrible person.

297
00:22:29.306 --> 00:22:32.768
But I can definitely cause trouble.

298
00:22:33.477 --> 00:22:34.686
I am very pushy.

299
00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:42.402
I will constantly bother you and catch you up,

300
00:22:43.153 --> 00:22:45.155
and you will no longer be able to live

301
00:22:45.238 --> 00:22:48.116
in peace and quiet
which you enjoy every day.

302
00:22:48.658 --> 00:22:49.743
you understand

303
00:22:49.826 --> 00:22:52.412
one termite can
slowly chew through the wood like

304
00:22:52.496 --> 00:22:54.623
that eventually the whole house will fall.

305
00:23:00.003 --> 00:23:02.464
God, I have a new fan.

306
00:23:02.547 --> 00:23:04.341
I'm too popular for my own good.

307
00:23:10.138 --> 00:23:11.890
But you should not do this.

308
00:23:11.973 --> 00:23:13.725
I am a concrete building.

309
00:23:14.309 --> 00:23:15.227
Be there.

310
00:23:25.195 --> 00:23:27.239
Come sit at the bar. He is around the corner.

311
00:23:27.322 --> 00:23:29.032
Are you sure you don't want to?

312
00:23:29.116 --> 00:23:30.367
Damage.

313
00:23:32.577 --> 00:23:33.787
Want to sit at the bar?

314
00:23:33.870 --> 00:23:37.124
I will give you free drinks and food
and meet hot men.

315
00:23:38.250 --> 00:23:39.292
get up

316
00:23:40.836 --> 00:23:43.338
- Come back if you change your mind!
- Why am I a boring boy?

317
00:23:49.136 --> 00:23:50.262
What...

318
00:23:55.767 --> 00:23:56.852
It hurts.

319
00:24:02.607 --> 00:24:04.609
Go get me another drink!

320
00:24:04.693 --> 00:24:07.487
I ordered to bring me another drink!

321
00:24:16.872 --> 00:24:18.373
where are you hiding

322
00:24:18.456 --> 00:24:20.333
Chin Ka Yeon!

323
00:24:20.417 --> 00:24:22.085
Get out immediately!

324
00:24:22.169 --> 00:24:24.421
Shall I spank you?

325
00:24:24.504 --> 00:24:27.507
A good girl must obey
when father says to bring a drink

326
00:24:27.591 --> 00:24:29.759
or fall down and die.

327
00:24:30.260 --> 00:24:33.180
How dare you be rude to me?

328
00:24:33.847 --> 00:24:35.098
The wretch

329
00:24:37.517 --> 00:24:39.978
Got caught, you devilish rat.

330
00:24:40.061 --> 00:24:43.523
Do you think you can hide from me?

331
00:24:58.121 --> 00:24:59.372
who are you

332
00:24:59.456 --> 00:25:02.626
What the hell are you doing in my house?

333
00:25:02.709 --> 00:25:03.627
Congratulations.

334
00:25:03.710 --> 00:25:05.212
I came to collect your debt.

335
00:25:05.295 --> 00:25:06.588
Are you a loan shark?

336
00:25:06.671 --> 00:25:08.673
OK, I'll give the money.

337
00:25:08.757 --> 00:25:09.883
How many?

338
00:25:09.966 --> 00:25:12.969
Ten years ago you sold my soul
for 100 million won.

339
00:25:13.887 --> 00:25:15.222
And I came for her.

340
00:25:15.305 --> 00:25:17.807
What? Ten years ago?

341
00:25:17.891 --> 00:25:19.559
don't you remember

342
00:25:20.602 --> 00:25:22.812
You were quite drunk even then.

343
00:25:22.896 --> 00:25:24.189
Let me remind you.

344
00:25:25.315 --> 00:25:29.486
You lost all your money at once
which I gave you

345
00:25:29.569 --> 00:25:32.781
I thought it was a dream.

346
00:25:32.864 --> 00:25:33.698
No.

347
00:25:35.325 --> 00:25:36.618
Here is the proof.

348
00:25:39.579 --> 00:25:40.789
Devil.

349
00:25:41.373 --> 00:25:42.874
Take my soul if you can.

350
00:25:43.458 --> 00:25:44.709
If you touch it with your finger,

351
00:25:44.793 --> 00:25:46.878
I will cut off your whole arm!

352
00:25:48.713 --> 00:25:49.547
This hand?

353
00:26:05.105 --> 00:26:07.732
No need to gamble
how come you don't have talent and talent.

354
00:26:09.484 --> 00:26:10.610
come out

355
00:26:10.694 --> 00:26:12.404
No one will hurt you anymore.

356
00:26:21.913 --> 00:26:24.624
are you an angel

357
00:26:25.208 --> 00:26:27.877
I? Why do you think so?

358
00:26:27.961 --> 00:26:29.879
You saved me.

359
00:26:36.011 --> 00:26:37.345
Angels…

360
00:26:38.221 --> 00:26:39.764
never come to the rescue.

361
00:26:40.515 --> 00:26:43.268
Then who are you?

362
00:26:44.269 --> 00:26:45.228
I am a demon.

363
00:26:45.854 --> 00:26:48.356
You people call me the devil.

364
00:26:49.858 --> 00:26:50.859
Daemon?

365
00:27:05.790 --> 00:27:07.500
Sir!

366
00:27:07.584 --> 00:27:09.169
Take me with you!

367
00:27:09.753 --> 00:27:11.588
I do not sign agreements with children.

368
00:27:11.671 --> 00:27:13.048
Then let's make deals!

369
00:27:13.715 --> 00:27:16.509
I cook and wash well!

370
00:27:16.593 --> 00:27:18.011
I can do everything well!

371
00:27:18.094 --> 00:27:19.054
No, thank you.

372
00:27:37.197 --> 00:27:38.907
<i>I will find you.</i>

373
00:27:40.158 --> 00:27:41.659
<i>I will find you in spite of everything,</i>

374
00:27:42.744 --> 00:27:43.787
<i>and I...</i>

375
00:27:53.129 --> 00:27:55.215
Do you even know how hard it was to find you?

376
00:27:59.260 --> 00:28:01.930
Can you imagine what I still have?

377
00:28:06.351 --> 00:28:08.228
sorry is everything ok

378
00:28:10.939 --> 00:28:12.232
Did your boyfriend leave you?

379
00:28:12.315 --> 00:28:14.943
Stop crying, join us.

380
00:28:15.902 --> 00:28:18.321
- Go away.
- Don't do it like that.

381
00:28:18.405 --> 00:28:20.407
You can mess with me.

382
00:28:20.490 --> 00:28:21.783
What the hell?

383
00:28:22.575 --> 00:28:23.868
Go away, you scoundrel.

384
00:28:26.955 --> 00:28:29.624
What? Say it again, scumbag.

385
00:28:32.293 --> 00:28:33.420
is everything ok

386
00:28:33.503 --> 00:28:34.629
- Let go.
- Oh, okay.

387
00:28:34.712 --> 00:28:36.548
- Well, hit me.
- Small...

388
00:28:36.631 --> 00:28:38.758
- Let go!
- Hit me, scoundrel!

389
00:28:47.600 --> 00:28:48.435
Director Chon.

390
00:28:54.274 --> 00:28:55.442
- Good.
- Let go.

391
00:28:55.525 --> 00:28:57.610
- I understand, so let me go!
- Let's just go.

392
00:29:00.822 --> 00:29:02.782
I knew you were back
you will come to save me

393
00:29:12.250 --> 00:29:15.086
Almost there, Zirko Chin.

394
00:29:15.170 --> 00:29:16.713
You are such a good girl.

395
00:29:17.297 --> 00:29:19.382
Let's sit down.

396
00:29:19.466 --> 00:29:20.759
That's it.

397
00:29:24.804 --> 00:29:26.097
Director Chong,

398
00:29:26.181 --> 00:29:28.266
you're not actually married, are you?

399
00:29:29.809 --> 00:29:31.728
It's just for show, right?

400
00:29:36.316 --> 00:29:37.358
Yes.

401
00:29:39.819 --> 00:29:41.154
Okay then.

402
00:29:41.905 --> 00:29:43.782
That's all I need to know.

403
00:29:44.365 --> 00:29:48.077
God, I feel so sorry for her.

404
00:29:50.538 --> 00:29:52.373
I've got a problem, Mr. Puck.

405
00:29:55.001 --> 00:29:56.044
Not her.

406
00:29:56.127 --> 00:29:57.212
And who?

407
00:29:57.295 --> 00:29:59.005
Choo Seok Hoon will watch over me.

408
00:29:59.964 --> 00:30:02.509
I told you
that you will break many hearts

409
00:30:02.592 --> 00:30:04.427
if you marry To To Hee.

410
00:30:05.720 --> 00:30:08.890
Conceived resentment is a terrible thing.
We have a big problem here.

411
00:30:10.475 --> 00:30:12.602
And if he does something?

412
00:30:12.685 --> 00:30:14.813
What exactly? I doubt it.

413
00:30:16.314 --> 00:30:17.148
This does not bode well.

414
00:30:21.069 --> 00:30:22.946
Signing papers again?

415
00:30:23.571 --> 00:30:27.408
{\an8}"Sunvol Foundation" does not stop its work
only because you are not here.

416
00:30:30.328 --> 00:30:33.122
How is your marriage?

417
00:30:33.206 --> 00:30:34.207
I don't know.

418
00:30:34.290 --> 00:30:36.167
No way and inconvenient.

419
00:30:36.793 --> 00:30:37.961
{\an8}As expected.

420
00:30:40.463 --> 00:30:44.050
Be that as it may, but it's easier for me
for To To Hee is eternally in my presence.

421
00:30:46.386 --> 00:30:48.471
I'm talking about dad.

422
00:30:48.555 --> 00:30:51.683
I feel relieved
because dad is always in my presence.

423
00:30:51.766 --> 00:30:53.101
Seriously…

424
00:30:58.523 --> 00:31:01.109
By the way, something strange happened today.

425
00:31:01.192 --> 00:31:02.026
What exactly?

426
00:31:02.110 --> 00:31:03.403
My strength

427
00:31:04.696 --> 00:31:06.197
blinked

428
00:31:06.281 --> 00:31:08.992
This is funny. What are they, a fluorescent lamp?

429
00:31:09.075 --> 00:31:10.618
They suddenly stopped working.

430
00:31:11.202 --> 00:31:13.413
But when I tried again,

431
00:31:14.414 --> 00:31:15.415
everything was fine.

432
00:31:15.498 --> 00:31:16.916
{\an8}Maybe there was a bad connection.

433
00:31:17.000 --> 00:31:20.128
I thought so
but it has happened to me before.

434
00:31:20.211 --> 00:31:22.005
When I had an accident with To To Hee.

435
00:31:22.755 --> 00:31:23.590
This is true.

436
00:31:23.673 --> 00:31:26.593
you said about it
when they first lost their strength.

437
00:31:26.676 --> 00:31:30.179
What were the symptoms before
how did they blink

438
00:31:31.306 --> 00:31:34.642
I had the same dream this morning.

439
00:31:39.814 --> 00:31:41.065
is it possible

440
00:31:41.774 --> 00:31:42.901
what do you become human

441
00:31:42.984 --> 00:31:43.818
Do I become a person?

442
00:31:43.902 --> 00:31:46.571
The longer you stay without strength,
you remember more.

443
00:31:46.654 --> 00:31:50.658
And the more you become a person,
then your strength becomes weaker.

444
00:31:50.742 --> 00:31:51.576
You are right.

445
00:31:52.368 --> 00:31:54.871
If you think about it,
it doesn't look like me to worry

446
00:31:54.954 --> 00:31:57.540
sudden outbursts of the illogical
and unnecessary emotions.

447
00:31:57.624 --> 00:31:59.417
Illogical and unnecessary emotions?

448
00:31:59.500 --> 00:32:02.670
Some guilt and sympathy.

449
00:32:02.754 --> 00:32:04.088
And who...

450
00:32:04.172 --> 00:32:05.089
What?

451
00:32:06.382 --> 00:32:07.800
That's all.

452
00:32:08.843 --> 00:32:10.762
{\an8}It really doesn't look like you.

453
00:32:10.845 --> 00:32:12.430
Don't come forward until you get the tattoo back.

454
00:32:12.513 --> 00:32:14.474
And if something happens when your powers…

455
00:32:14.557 --> 00:32:16.392
Okay, I got it!

456
00:32:16.476 --> 00:32:18.353
Don't bother me.

457
00:32:20.271 --> 00:32:23.650
I'm not boring. I express concern.

458
00:32:26.527 --> 00:32:28.029
when i get dad back

459
00:32:30.114 --> 00:32:31.282
all…

460
00:32:32.825 --> 00:32:34.202
will be back to normal, right?

461
00:32:36.329 --> 00:32:37.580
And my strength...

462
00:32:41.751 --> 00:32:42.710
and emotions.

463
00:32:45.421 --> 00:32:47.173
{\an8}"SUNVOL FOUNDATION"

464
00:33:48.192 --> 00:33:49.235
How crazy.

465
00:34:47.293 --> 00:34:49.670
So you came home at night?

466
00:34:50.254 --> 00:34:51.422
You are not asleep yet.

467
00:34:52.340 --> 00:34:54.675
How could I go to sleep
if you didn't even know where you were?

468
00:34:55.259 --> 00:34:56.803
Were you worried about me?

469
00:34:57.386 --> 00:34:58.387
If so.

470
00:34:59.222 --> 00:35:01.766
people worry
even when the dog doesn't come home

471
00:35:01.849 --> 00:35:03.392
but you don't understand.

472
00:35:03.476 --> 00:35:05.645
- Since you are back, I will go to sleep.
- Hold on.

473
00:35:06.270 --> 00:35:08.523
I want to recharge.

474
00:35:08.606 --> 00:35:09.607
Recharge?

475
00:35:19.408 --> 00:35:20.743
do you really think

476
00:35:20.827 --> 00:35:23.287
that thanks to this
will your powers not flicker?

477
00:35:25.581 --> 00:35:27.416
We have to try everything we can.

478
00:35:31.921 --> 00:35:34.006
Maybe you need to make a new deal?

479
00:35:36.551 --> 00:35:38.553
There are no signs of spontaneous combustion.

480
00:35:39.554 --> 00:35:42.390
I must have exhausted my strength
when he moved us.

481
00:35:45.726 --> 00:35:47.061
Then we have to be careful.

482
00:35:51.607 --> 00:35:54.193
Ignore me and go to sleep.

483
00:35:56.404 --> 00:35:59.532
I can't sleep when someone is around
so sleep alone.

484
00:36:00.366 --> 00:36:02.285
Demons don't need to sleep.

485
00:36:03.411 --> 00:36:04.996
Well, I think you won't sleep all night.

486
00:37:09.602 --> 00:37:12.855
<i>This illogical and unnecessary emotion,</i>

487
00:37:14.232 --> 00:37:15.650
<i>which will soon disappear...</i>

488
00:38:21.090 --> 00:38:22.008
Mrs. Sin

489
00:38:32.977 --> 00:38:34.145
Hello Ms. Sin?

490
00:38:34.228 --> 00:38:36.230
<i>We have a problem, Ms. To.</i>

491
00:38:38.024 --> 00:38:40.026
Who gained the most from the death of Chief Chu?

492
00:38:40.109 --> 00:38:41.235
To To Hee.

493
00:38:41.319 --> 00:38:44.196
Why should she not leave anything to the children,
successful CEOs,

494
00:38:44.280 --> 00:38:46.115
and give everything to some girl?

495
00:38:46.198 --> 00:38:48.034
This is illogical.

496
00:38:48.117 --> 00:38:49.327
- More important...
- More important...

497
00:38:49.410 --> 00:38:50.578
Her will was changed…

498
00:38:50.661 --> 00:38:52.496
On the day of Chairman Chu's death.

499
00:38:52.580 --> 00:38:54.248
- On the day of Chairman Chu's death.
- ...the death of Chu head.

500
00:38:54.332 --> 00:38:55.374
On the day of Chairman Chu's death.

501
00:38:55.458 --> 00:38:58.419
- It is unclean with a will.
- She was cremated to destroy the evidence.

502
00:38:58.502 --> 00:38:59.337
She…

503
00:38:59.420 --> 00:39:01.380
<i>What is she, the witch of the century?</i>

504
00:39:02.381 --> 00:39:03.883
PRINCESS "MIRE GROUP"
KILLED FOR INHERITANCE?

505
00:39:08.137 --> 00:39:10.056
Did she kill for her inheritance?

506
00:39:10.639 --> 00:39:11.807
What? What happened?

507
00:39:13.017 --> 00:39:14.226
Madness.

508
00:39:15.895 --> 00:39:19.565
DEATH OF THE HEAD OF THE MIRE GROUP CHU
DID THE CEO WANTED A HERITAGE?

509
00:39:19.648 --> 00:39:21.150
No leniency.

510
00:39:21.233 --> 00:39:23.277
Answer firmly!

511
00:39:23.361 --> 00:39:24.403
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

512
00:39:25.112 --> 00:39:26.238
- Hello.
- Yes.

513
00:39:26.322 --> 00:39:28.866
- We have to go to court.
- And you! you are done

514
00:39:28.949 --> 00:39:31.369
- if you do not remove the article.
- Answer firmly!

515
00:39:31.452 --> 00:39:33.913
"News-clickbait"
first released this fake,

516
00:39:33.996 --> 00:39:36.457
which then went viral on social networks
and online communities.

517
00:39:36.540 --> 00:39:39.585
Even the press got involved
to the spread of disinformation.

518
00:39:39.668 --> 00:39:41.670
We went to court and removed the articles,

519
00:39:41.754 --> 00:39:45.216
but we can't handle it
with all new articles.

520
00:39:45.299 --> 00:39:48.803
What exactly did Mr. Lee hear at the wedding?

521
00:39:48.886 --> 00:39:50.471
When will you release the story?

522
00:39:50.554 --> 00:39:51.931
Today is a happy day.

523
00:39:52.807 --> 00:39:54.392
Let him enjoy.

524
00:39:55.059 --> 00:39:57.603
Mr. Lee thought
that it is a surprise gift.

525
00:39:58.187 --> 00:39:59.647
It caught me by surprise.

526
00:40:00.523 --> 00:40:02.900
The board of directors evaluates the candidates
for the position of chairman?

527
00:40:02.983 --> 00:40:04.276
Yes.

528
00:40:04.360 --> 00:40:06.570
But they will come together
to the detriment of the corporate image

529
00:40:06.654 --> 00:40:08.656
and they will reject your candidacy.

530
00:40:10.741 --> 00:40:12.660
Has the legal department gathered for a meeting?

531
00:40:12.743 --> 00:40:14.745
- Yes.
- Please start without me.

532
00:40:14.829 --> 00:40:15.871
Yes, ma'am.

533
00:40:19.458 --> 00:40:22.002
Let me go talk
with council members.

534
00:40:22.086 --> 00:40:25.881
I will try to convince those
who is on good terms with Aunt Jeong Suk…

535
00:40:25.965 --> 00:40:27.716
Maybe we'll take the easy way first?

536
00:40:28.217 --> 00:40:29.218
What exactly?

537
00:40:29.301 --> 00:40:32.847
Why not us personally?
