will give them reasons
reject my candidacy.

827
01:03:04.071 --> 01:03:04.989
Don't worry.

828
01:03:05.823 --> 01:03:07.074
Everything will be fine.

829
01:03:10.995 --> 01:03:12.455
Everything will be fine.

830
01:03:26.385 --> 01:03:27.929
<i>Starting the hunt for the monster.</i>

831
01:03:46.614 --> 01:03:48.157
Mrs. Sin

